---
import { v9Href } from '~/data/v9/routes';
---

<section class="g-paper" id="priced">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-v9-reveal><span class="tick">\</span> 04 · What you’re buying</div>
    <h2 data-v9-reveal style="--d:60ms">Eight are priced before we start.</h2>
    <p class="lead" data-v9-reveal style="--d:120ms">
      The other four are paid, at least in part, when someone joins your team. Those are the red ones.
    </p>
    <div class="sv-tiles" data-v9-reveal style="--d:160ms">
      <a class="sv-tile" href="#sv-scorecard"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Role scorecard</b><span>Fixed fee</span></a
      ><a class="sv-tile" href="#sv-review"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Pipeline review</b><span>Fixed fee</span></a><a
        class="sv-tile sv-tile--h"
        href="#sv-perm"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Permanent hire</b><span>% of annual CTC, on hire</span></a
      ><a class="sv-tile" href="#sv-contract"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Contract hire</b><span>Monthly rate</span></a
      ><a class="sv-tile sv-tile--h" href="#sv-iaas"
        ><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Interview as a service</b><span>Per interview, plus a success fee</span></a
      ><a class="sv-tile sv-tile--h" href="#sv-managed"
        ><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Managed hiring</b><span>Monthly retainer, plus a fee per hire</span></a
      ><a class="sv-tile sv-tile--h" href="#sv-exec"
        ><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Executive search</b><span>Retained in stages</span></a
      ><a class="sv-tile" href="#sv-delivery"
        ><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Managed delivery team</b><span>Fixed price</span></a
      ><a class="sv-tile" href="#sv-bot"
        ><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Build, operate, transfer</b><span>Fixed price</span></a
      ><a class="sv-tile" href="#sv-team"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Team assessment</b><span>Fixed fee</span></a><a
        class="sv-tile"
        href="#sv-library"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Scorecard library</b><span>Fixed fee</span></a
      ><a class="sv-tile" href="#sv-process"
        ><i aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Hiring process review</b><span>Fixed fee</span></a
      >
    </div>
    <p class="sv-tiles-k" data-v9-reveal>
      <span><i></i> Fixed fee, price or rate, agreed in writing</span><span
        ><i class="r"></i> Paid when someone joins</span
      >
    </p>
    <p class="sv-sample" data-v9-reveal>
      <a class="link" href={v9Href('/__v9/sample-write-up', Astro.url.pathname)}
        >What a scored candidate looks like: request a sample write-up ›</a
      >
    </p>
    <div class="proof-checks sv-why">
      <div data-v9-reveal style="--d:0ms">
        <h3>The price comes first.</h3><p>
          Scope and fee are written down before anything starts. No hourly billing, and no invoice you didn’t expect.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div data-v9-reveal style="--d:90ms">
        <h3>The work leaves with you.</h3><p>
          Scorecards, interview guides and reports are yours to run without us. We’d rather be hired again than depended
          on.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div data-v9-reveal style="--d:180ms">
        <h3>So we can be straight with you.</h3><p>
          We can say the brief is wrong, or that your hire is already in your rejected pile, without it costing us the
          engagement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
